WEBVTT

01:35.780 --> 01:38.250
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.420 --> 01:41.300
[Episode 13]

01:41.780 --> 01:42.420
Yi Lan.

01:45.110 --> 01:45.970
Anything else?

01:50.590 --> 01:51.430
What's wrong?

01:51.990 --> 01:53.350
Spit it out.

01:57.300 --> 01:57.910
I like you.

02:04.300 --> 02:04.820
Me?

02:06.180 --> 02:07.960
Don't you have a girl you like?

02:09.550 --> 02:10.110
Yes.

02:11.470 --> 02:13.130
That girl has always been you.

02:18.020 --> 02:19.079
I reject you.

02:48.900 --> 02:50.460
The books are a bit messy.

03:09.870 --> 03:11.580
The speaker is covered in dust.

03:11.580 --> 03:13.620
It's been a few days since it was wiped.

03:13.620 --> 03:14.990
It needs to be wiped.

03:24.579 --> 03:25.870
Alright, alright.

03:26.579 --> 03:27.620
Stop wiping. Stop wiping.

03:27.620 --> 03:29.550
Move this cello to the repair room.

03:30.430 --> 03:32.030
Be careful, it's a bit heavy.

03:37.470 --> 03:38.060
Where are you going?

03:38.060 --> 03:39.590
The repair room is this way.

03:39.710 --> 03:40.300
Oh.

03:51.430 --> 03:51.990
Tell me.

03:54.500 --> 03:55.430
Tell you what?

03:56.020 --> 03:58.460
You're definitely hiding something
from me.

03:58.460 --> 03:59.460
Nothing.

04:01.430 --> 04:02.270
Tell me now.

04:03.580 --> 04:06.020
-It's hard to talk about.
-You have to! I give you 5 seconds!

04:06.020 --> 04:06.460
Five.

04:06.460 --> 04:06.780
Four.

04:06.780 --> 04:07.460
-I'll say it then!
-Three.

04:07.460 --> 04:07.740
Two.

04:07.740 --> 04:07.990
One.

04:07.990 --> 04:08.300
I'm going to say it.

04:08.300 --> 04:09.430
-Say it!
-I love you!

04:19.910 --> 04:21.029
Well...

04:21.470 --> 04:22.740
Shan,

04:23.030 --> 04:25.470
I think
I really have fallen in love with you.

04:25.470 --> 04:27.990
The kind of love a girl has for a boy.

04:28.660 --> 04:30.720
Do you know what Xiaoyi said love is?

04:31.060 --> 04:32.940
Love is when your face gets really hot.

04:32.940 --> 04:35.540
It turns red,
and your heart beats really fast.

04:35.620 --> 04:37.909
That day, it was raining and you
held the umbrella for me, remember?

04:37.909 --> 04:39.500
My face was very red,

04:39.500 --> 04:41.060
and my heart was beating really fast.

04:41.060 --> 04:42.030
And that's when I was sure.

04:42.030 --> 04:42.500
Wait a minute.

04:42.500 --> 04:42.909
I...

04:43.940 --> 04:45.540
I've fallen in love with you.

04:48.260 --> 04:49.060
Wait a minute.

04:50.940 --> 04:53.800
Where did you go
during these days you disappeared?

04:56.820 --> 04:59.220
I broke off my friendship
with Tong Xiaole.

05:03.500 --> 05:05.740
The person you've fallen in love with
definitely isn't me.

05:05.740 --> 05:07.650
The person I've fallen in love with
is you.

05:07.650 --> 05:09.010
Do you know what love is?

05:09.430 --> 05:10.060
Love is...

05:12.950 --> 05:13.410
Love...

05:24.770 --> 05:25.570
What's wrong?

05:25.700 --> 05:27.360
Is there something on my face?

05:28.380 --> 05:28.820
No.

05:29.350 --> 05:30.060
See?

05:30.180 --> 05:31.620
The person you love isn't me at all.

05:31.620 --> 05:33.110
What's between us is just

05:33.470 --> 05:34.740
a sibling-like bond.

05:36.590 --> 05:38.360
Besides, in my heart...

05:39.909 --> 05:42.440
there's always been someone
I can't let go of.

05:47.060 --> 05:47.940
Siblings?

05:53.260 --> 05:54.909
Then what is real love?

05:59.180 --> 06:00.430
What is love?

06:10.740 --> 06:11.620
Love is...

06:16.750 --> 06:17.880
It's that kind of...

06:18.380 --> 06:20.140
You want to be very close to him,

06:20.140 --> 06:22.380
but you can't be that close. That...

06:24.260 --> 06:25.460
That kind of feeling—

06:27.140 --> 06:27.940
it hurts.

06:32.909 --> 06:33.970
Do you understand?

07:09.470 --> 07:10.180
You are...

07:11.060 --> 07:11.600
Hello.

07:11.620 --> 07:12.820
My name is Luo Ningzi.

07:12.940 --> 07:14.470
I'm here for the interview.

07:17.820 --> 07:18.620
Luo Ningzi.

07:21.380 --> 07:22.380
Top of your major.

07:24.380 --> 07:25.060
Luo Ningzi,

07:25.820 --> 07:27.650
welcome to the Trio Orchestra.

07:29.700 --> 07:32.230
Don't I need to play on site
for the interview?

07:32.940 --> 07:34.940
Look. You're already top of your major.

07:34.940 --> 07:35.940
No need for an interview.

07:35.940 --> 07:37.490
Your cello skills must be very good.

07:37.490 --> 07:38.090
By the way,

07:38.380 --> 07:41.060
do you have time for a rehearsal
at 8 p.m. tomorrow?

07:41.060 --> 07:41.870
Yes.

07:42.820 --> 07:45.300
But I'd still like to ask

07:45.300 --> 07:46.380
about the performance fee.

07:46.380 --> 07:47.360
Don't worry.

07:47.740 --> 07:48.670
It's much higher

07:48.820 --> 07:50.420
than what you're expecting.

07:51.500 --> 07:53.250
Here. See you tomorrow.

07:53.590 --> 07:56.380
-Okay. I'll go back and prepare properly.
-Mm. Okay.

07:56.380 --> 07:56.980
Thank you.

07:57.620 --> 07:58.150
Go ahead.

08:05.260 --> 08:06.390
You can come out now.

08:11.700 --> 08:12.620
Yu.

08:15.140 --> 08:16.700
Luo Ningzi is very outstanding.

08:16.700 --> 08:17.620
Even without your recommendation,

08:17.620 --> 08:19.060
she could still get in.

08:19.820 --> 08:21.950
Top of her major at Hailan University.

08:23.060 --> 08:23.940
I heard you...

08:24.910 --> 08:25.990
like this watch very much.

08:25.990 --> 08:26.940
No need. No need.

08:27.820 --> 08:30.880
Just consider it me asking you
to take good care of Ning.

08:32.380 --> 08:32.950
What?

08:34.140 --> 08:35.470
Is she your girlfriend?

08:36.950 --> 08:38.500
You even noticed that?

08:38.590 --> 08:40.120
It's pretty obvious, okay?

08:41.380 --> 08:41.980
By the way,

08:42.380 --> 08:44.140
learning the cello is very expensive.
Right?

08:44.140 --> 08:46.940
Is it okay for her
to work and study at the same time?

08:49.380 --> 08:50.380
Ning's family...

08:50.500 --> 08:51.760
ran into some trouble.

08:52.140 --> 08:53.380
If she has any situation in the future,

08:53.380 --> 08:54.910
just let me know privately.

08:55.350 --> 08:56.500
But be sure to remember,

08:56.500 --> 08:59.020
don't bring this up in front of her.

08:59.380 --> 09:00.660
Don't worry.

09:02.150 --> 09:03.010
That's good.

09:39.420 --> 09:39.990
Sir.

09:40.230 --> 09:42.540
Thank you for coming to see me
despite your busy schedule.

09:42.540 --> 09:43.450
Mm. Not bad.

09:44.260 --> 09:45.260
Let me introduce her to you.

09:45.260 --> 09:46.660
This is our violist.

09:47.540 --> 09:48.470
You played well.

09:48.500 --> 09:49.280
Thank you.

09:50.020 --> 09:50.660
Cai Yu,

09:51.230 --> 09:52.500
your cellist

09:52.540 --> 09:53.940
performed very well too.

09:54.620 --> 09:56.500
Then... let me introduce her to you.

09:56.500 --> 09:56.900
Okay.

09:57.500 --> 09:58.260
You two chat.

09:58.420 --> 09:58.870
Okay.

10:00.500 --> 10:02.140
In this field,

10:02.500 --> 10:04.740
what expectations
do you have for yourself?

10:04.740 --> 10:06.350
I want to keep improving.

10:06.870 --> 10:07.230
Ning,

10:07.620 --> 10:09.780
my mentor specially came
to see my performance.

10:09.780 --> 10:11.540
The chief conductor
of the Dream Orchestra.

10:11.540 --> 10:13.000
You must have heard of him.

10:13.260 --> 10:15.570
Every music student probably knows him.

10:16.020 --> 10:16.620
Besides,

10:17.260 --> 10:19.640
I've seen him conduct a few times.

10:19.780 --> 10:20.240
Then...

10:20.470 --> 10:21.930
I'll introduce you to him.

10:22.900 --> 10:23.360
Really?

10:23.540 --> 10:23.870
Come.

10:30.350 --> 10:31.500
What's wrong with you?

10:31.500 --> 10:33.560
Something came up at your home again?

10:43.660 --> 10:44.740
Listen,

10:45.500 --> 10:46.540
if you get hammered later,

10:46.540 --> 10:47.740
I won't take you home.

10:48.260 --> 10:49.870
I'll ask Yi Lan to come get you.

10:49.870 --> 10:50.420
Don't.

10:53.260 --> 10:54.460
If you ask her to come,

10:55.740 --> 10:57.470
I'll break off our friendship.

10:58.140 --> 10:59.470
Seriously?

11:08.260 --> 11:09.460
You confessed to her?

11:12.620 --> 11:13.550
How did you know?

11:14.230 --> 11:15.160
Did she tell you?

11:15.260 --> 11:18.500
Even a fool can tell you like her.

11:31.110 --> 11:32.240
So she rejected you?

11:44.500 --> 11:45.710
I thought

11:48.070 --> 11:50.330
we'd be together forever no matter what.

11:52.260 --> 11:53.020
But...

11:55.080 --> 11:56.550
now she's left me.

11:59.140 --> 12:00.230
Forever?

12:02.260 --> 12:03.230
Forever.

12:04.660 --> 12:05.380
Really?

12:07.900 --> 12:08.260
I...

12:08.900 --> 12:09.620
Yeah.

12:09.870 --> 12:12.740
Only you and I
can be together forever, okay?

12:12.740 --> 12:13.500
Buddy.

12:17.260 --> 12:18.350
Forever.

12:20.260 --> 12:21.110
Chen Fan.

12:21.350 --> 12:22.140
President Chen.

12:22.140 --> 12:23.230
Mr. Chen.

12:25.420 --> 12:26.540
For those words,

12:27.370 --> 12:29.800
I must drink a toast to you.

12:35.230 --> 12:36.020
Okay.

12:36.870 --> 12:39.730
Today, however much you drink,
I'll drink the same.

12:41.780 --> 12:42.980
You don't believe me?

12:49.870 --> 12:51.950
Welcome to the broken hearts club.

12:52.100 --> 12:53.030
How did you know?

12:53.110 --> 12:54.040
How did you know?

12:54.050 --> 12:55.140
Alright, alright.

12:55.660 --> 12:56.670
Forget it.

13:08.590 --> 13:09.870
Actually,

13:11.620 --> 13:12.140
I...

13:13.020 --> 13:16.290
We have both already very sincerely

13:17.500 --> 13:19.560
expressed our true feelings, but...

13:20.350 --> 13:22.110
when it comes to love,

13:25.590 --> 13:26.930
it really is

13:27.870 --> 13:29.400
something you can't force.

13:41.190 --> 13:42.600
So I don't think you...

13:45.140 --> 13:46.400
should blame Yi Lan...

13:46.710 --> 13:47.590
too much.

14:01.620 --> 14:02.660
Maybe,

14:04.140 --> 14:05.380
perhaps,

14:08.110 --> 14:09.020
probably,

14:10.110 --> 14:10.910
you should...

14:11.110 --> 14:12.260
just let it go.

14:24.620 --> 14:25.380
After all,

14:25.870 --> 14:28.200
you've known each other for so many years.

14:30.780 --> 14:32.380
Continuing to be friends...

14:33.350 --> 14:34.410
is pretty good too.

14:53.740 --> 14:54.740
Are you blind?

14:57.540 --> 14:58.740
Don't. Don't. Don't.

15:01.110 --> 15:02.080
Screw you!

15:03.990 --> 15:06.000
This is wonderful!

15:08.420 --> 15:09.030
You hit me?

15:09.380 --> 15:10.260
Guys, hit them!

15:10.540 --> 15:11.400
Surround them!

15:20.230 --> 15:21.830
What happened to your mouth?

15:22.470 --> 15:23.270
It's nothing.

15:38.020 --> 15:38.620
Shan.

15:45.500 --> 15:46.520
That day,

15:46.740 --> 15:47.870
I was too impulsive.

15:48.140 --> 15:48.750
I'm sorry.

15:52.870 --> 15:53.470
It's okay.

15:57.660 --> 15:58.020
You...

15:58.020 --> 15:58.620
So...

16:01.990 --> 16:02.740
S-So,

16:02.740 --> 16:04.470
the person... in your heart

16:04.470 --> 16:06.130
has always been Professor Ye?

16:09.740 --> 16:10.200
Then...

16:10.380 --> 16:11.980
Then that day, why did you...

16:12.230 --> 16:13.290
When I asked you...

16:21.620 --> 16:22.480
Between you...

16:22.620 --> 16:23.480
and Lan,

16:23.900 --> 16:24.830
what's going on?

16:27.050 --> 16:28.110
I confessed to her.

16:30.590 --> 16:31.790
You confessed to her?

16:32.200 --> 16:33.690
Didn't you tell me to confess to her?

16:33.690 --> 16:33.990
I...

16:34.660 --> 16:37.060
I didn't tell you to confess
in such a hurry.

16:37.380 --> 16:39.310
You didn't say that that day, Shan.

16:42.410 --> 16:44.740
Then let me
have a good talk with you today.

16:47.620 --> 16:48.470
Do you know

16:49.110 --> 16:51.370
what the most important thing in love is?

16:54.420 --> 16:56.550
Distance makes the heart grow fonder.

16:58.230 --> 16:59.830
You need to learn restraint.

17:00.420 --> 17:02.310
You need to give her space to...

17:02.620 --> 17:04.109
to grow and feel.

17:06.260 --> 17:06.920
Restraint.

17:07.660 --> 17:08.390
Understand?

17:24.780 --> 17:26.500
[Do Not Disturb]

17:26.660 --> 17:29.060
Distance makes the heart grow fonder.

17:29.350 --> 17:30.950
You need to learn restraint.

17:41.550 --> 17:42.180
[Student Practice Room 10]

17:58.220 --> 17:59.550
I have a piece of bad news

18:00.460 --> 18:01.940
and a piece of worse news.

18:03.790 --> 18:05.070
Which one do you want to hear first?

18:05.070 --> 18:05.730
The bad one.

18:06.590 --> 18:07.030
The bad one?

18:07.030 --> 18:07.270
Mm.

18:09.380 --> 18:10.250
Xiaole...

18:10.660 --> 18:11.620
confessed to me.

18:16.260 --> 18:16.740
And?

18:17.420 --> 18:18.820
What about the worse one?

18:20.070 --> 18:21.490
I confessed to Shan.

18:22.620 --> 18:25.350
What?

18:27.030 --> 18:27.940
And the result?

18:28.620 --> 18:29.740
The result is...

18:30.110 --> 18:31.310
I rejected him.

18:32.110 --> 18:32.870
And he...

18:33.070 --> 18:33.830
rejected me.

18:35.010 --> 18:37.940
Why did you confess to Shan?

18:38.550 --> 18:39.910
I don't know either.

18:39.970 --> 18:41.500
I thought I liked him.

18:41.620 --> 18:43.280
What made you think like that?

18:47.940 --> 18:49.040
But it's so weird.

18:49.140 --> 18:50.580
After Shan rejected me,

18:50.660 --> 18:51.980
I wasn't sad at all.

18:52.380 --> 18:53.910
And I looked it up online.

18:54.070 --> 18:56.220
They say the signs of loving someone

18:56.310 --> 18:57.640
are... feeling jealous

18:57.900 --> 18:58.870
and being possessive.

18:58.870 --> 18:59.350
Mm.

18:59.380 --> 19:02.230
And taking the initiative
to share your life with them.

19:02.230 --> 19:02.590
Mm.

19:02.590 --> 19:04.380
And taking the initiative to apologize.

19:04.380 --> 19:07.110
I indeed have never acted
like that towards Shan.

19:07.830 --> 19:08.830
Isn't that...

19:08.900 --> 19:10.620
how you act towards Xiaole?

19:10.790 --> 19:11.380
Mm.

19:15.460 --> 19:16.180
Really?

19:18.460 --> 19:18.870
Mm.

19:24.820 --> 19:26.870
What exactly is love?

19:34.900 --> 19:36.030
I don't know either.

19:49.310 --> 19:49.830
Look.

19:49.930 --> 19:50.810
[Hailan University]

19:57.220 --> 19:59.290
Say yes! Say yes!

20:03.380 --> 20:04.550
Show the ring.

20:04.620 --> 20:05.720
Yes.

20:06.380 --> 20:07.290
Where's yours?

20:07.900 --> 20:10.420
This video has gone viral
in the group chat.

20:11.660 --> 20:13.550
They are such a perfect match.

20:13.620 --> 20:14.150
-Mm.
-Mm.

20:14.660 --> 20:15.970
Why did they break up?

20:17.620 --> 20:18.970
I heard from classmates

20:19.140 --> 20:20.400
it might be because

20:20.420 --> 20:21.880
Professor Ye went abroad.

20:23.620 --> 20:24.680
Look at this video.

20:24.980 --> 20:27.140
Professor Ye was so lively and cheerful.

20:27.140 --> 20:28.940
So different from how she is now.

20:29.980 --> 20:31.350
Shan also told me

20:31.550 --> 20:33.750
there's been someone he can't let go of.

20:36.610 --> 20:39.270
He still can't forget her
after all these years?

20:40.180 --> 20:40.920
Do you think

20:40.940 --> 20:42.510
they've both stayed single

20:42.620 --> 20:44.880
because they've been waiting
for each other?

20:44.880 --> 20:46.260
Shan also told me

20:46.550 --> 20:48.650
his understanding of love is

20:48.900 --> 20:50.360
long-term companionship

20:50.540 --> 20:51.800
and growing together.

20:52.550 --> 20:53.630
Maybe...

20:54.140 --> 20:56.600
they truly have been waiting
for each other.

21:01.940 --> 21:03.940
Why think so much when in love?

21:04.700 --> 21:06.220
That's way too complicated.

21:06.220 --> 21:06.870
Mm.

21:32.380 --> 21:34.110
My cello's endpin has arrived.

21:34.750 --> 21:35.140
Oh.

21:37.830 --> 21:38.790
Let me take a look for you.

21:38.790 --> 21:39.590
Wait a second.

21:56.270 --> 21:58.940
You're still using this cello
after all these years?

21:58.940 --> 22:00.200
The endpin is worn out.

22:00.790 --> 22:01.650
I have new ones.

22:01.830 --> 22:02.760
Want to see them?

22:03.620 --> 22:05.880
I've grown attached to it over the years.

22:08.940 --> 22:09.940
Can you fix it?

22:11.460 --> 22:11.990
Not sure.

22:12.310 --> 22:13.590
It depends on whether the cello

22:13.590 --> 22:14.850
is willing to be fixed.

22:17.830 --> 22:19.690
You said before you lacked parts,

22:20.140 --> 22:21.340
so I've been waiting.

22:22.460 --> 22:22.940
What?

22:23.980 --> 22:25.980
You went to fix the cello stealthily?

22:25.980 --> 22:27.470
Who was being stealthy?

22:27.900 --> 22:30.100
The parts arrived, so I just went there.

22:30.420 --> 22:31.310
I saw you were in class,

22:31.310 --> 22:33.040
so I didn't want to disturb you.

22:33.220 --> 22:34.420
Stealthy?

22:34.890 --> 22:37.740
Did you go specifically on that day?

22:39.350 --> 22:40.550
It was a coincidence.

22:41.110 --> 22:42.110
A coincidence?

22:48.940 --> 22:50.900
This is the first record I gave you.

22:51.380 --> 22:52.980
You've kept it all this time?

22:57.870 --> 22:59.330
Of course I should keep it.

22:59.380 --> 23:01.710
That record is pretty precious after all.

23:03.660 --> 23:07.190
It's not like I have to throw it away
just because it was from you.

23:08.700 --> 23:09.140
Well,

23:09.620 --> 23:13.220
can you stop touching other people's stuff
without permission?

23:17.220 --> 23:19.080
I'll leave the cello here for now.

23:19.380 --> 23:20.980
I'll come get it another day.

23:23.700 --> 23:24.940
Fix it well for me.

23:26.900 --> 23:28.760
I'll let you know when it's fixed.

24:07.870 --> 24:08.510
Xiaole!

24:09.940 --> 24:11.070
What happened to your face?

24:11.070 --> 24:12.670
My wisdom tooth is inflamed.

24:14.090 --> 24:16.770
The light and shadow in my photos
haven't been great.

24:16.770 --> 24:17.900
Can you take a look for me?

24:17.900 --> 24:18.380
Sure.

24:31.150 --> 24:32.210
[Characteristics of DSLR Cameras]

24:32.230 --> 24:33.460
[Accurately Master
the Shooting Environment]

24:33.480 --> 24:34.730
[Faster Focusing Speed]

24:37.980 --> 24:38.510
Yi Lan,

24:38.830 --> 24:42.140
are you close with Tong Xiaole
from the Department of Photography?

24:42.140 --> 24:43.850
Are you his girlfriend?

24:44.410 --> 24:45.660
I'm his childhood friend.

24:45.660 --> 24:46.220
Why?

24:46.220 --> 24:46.900
I see.

24:47.350 --> 24:48.880
Then we all misunderstood.

24:49.590 --> 24:50.870
I'm a sophomore.

24:51.140 --> 24:53.270
Could you please help give this to him?

25:39.870 --> 25:47.140
[I like you]

26:22.660 --> 26:23.620
Xiaole.

26:24.870 --> 26:26.080
I'm sorry.

26:27.540 --> 26:29.640
Actually, I seriously thought

26:30.880 --> 26:32.490
about what you said that day.

26:33.460 --> 26:34.790
It was too sudden.

26:35.700 --> 26:36.690
I think...

